{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require all eligible UK citizens to vote with a \"None of the Above\" option",
        "additional_details": "Recently, turnout has often been low, meaning Governments are elected without significant participation. We believe mandatory voting ensures everyone takes part, while a \u201cNone of the Above\u201d option protects freedom of choice by allowing voters to reject all candidates. We feel this strengthens legitimacy and public trust in elections.",
        "background": "Introduce compulsory voting in UK general elections, with reasonable exemptions. Ballots must include a \u201cNone of the Above\u201d option so voters can formally reject all candidates without being forced to support any party.",
